# 统一行尾：工作区按系统本地规则检出，入库一律 LF（避免跨平台协作时整文件 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须为 CRLF，否则双击运行可能异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 明确标记为二进制，禁止换行转换或 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.db binary
